        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "During the negotiations for the collective bargaining agreement effective July 1, 2003 through June 30, 2007 the parties agreed to replace the side letter of May 28, 1997 and modify number 5 of the April 18, 2001 sideletter as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
