            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. At the forensic units operated by the Department of Public Welfare any Registered Nurse assigned from a civil ward to a forensic unit for a period over twenty (20) calendar days shall receive a two step in range salary adjustment retroactive to the first day of the temporary assignment. The in range salary adjustment shall be relinquished upon reassignment to a civil ward.",
            "block_bbox": [
                215,
                867,
                1088,
                1013
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    215.0,
                    867.0
                ],
                [
                    1088.0,
                    867.0
                ],
                [
                    1088.0,
                    1013.0
                ],
                [
                    215.0,
                    1013.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. At SCI Waymart any Registered Nurse who is temporarily assigned from the general population to the Forensic Treatment Center for a period over twenty (20) calendar days shall be entitled to the $155 biweekly payment retroactive to the first day of the temporary assignment. Payments under this provision may be pro-rated at the per diem rate $15.50 when the temporary assignment does not entail a full pay period.",
            "block_bbox": [
